                    "author": "Lapland",
                    "description": "From the beloved Christmas brand, LaplandUK.\n\nSnuggle down and drift off with the first-ever bedtime stories straight from the magical elven world of Lapland – told by none other than Father Christmas himself!\n\nHidden deep in the snowy forests, nestled under The Northern Wish Lights, Father Christmas is ready to share the secret stories of his enchanting homeland with Small Folk everywhere.\n\nThese gentle adventures follow Father Christmas, his busy band of elves, and the charming animals who call Lapland home - bringing to life a world full of kindness, mischief and wonder.\n\nSettle down and get cosy for ‘Christmas Bedtime Stories From Lapland’ this festive season.",
